// Grounded Brain: learning artifact status lifecycle
// Eraser "Flow Chart" diagram-as-code
title Artifact status lifecycle
direction right
colorMode bold

Start [shape: oval, color: gray, label: "start"]
PENDING [color: gray]
PROCESSING [color: blue]
READY [color: green]
FAILED [color: red]

Start > PENDING: POST /artifacts
PENDING > PROCESSING: Inngest job starts
PROCESSING > READY: content generated
PROCESSING > FAILED: generation error
